{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:36 2026-06-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:36 2026-06-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:36 2026-06-03 HKT</p><p>今晚快活谷第五場四班千二米木球會錦標，潘頓策騎賀廄的「星辰千帥」大熱門勝出。</p><p>賽後練馬師賀賢說：「『天下寵兒』一早領先，由於『星辰千帥』今仗入直路後出錯腳，因而增加贏馬的難度，追得比較辛苦，幸好最後都能夠勝出 。『星辰千帥』今場的贏馬距離很短，也非壞事，因為可以加少些分。馬兒跑同程很準，曾四度入位，今仗赢馬很合理，贏完今場後，將會休息，下季先至再跑過。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c5a078bcf57840af7b1c06683ddf925f/2026-06/0acc0854-65a8-4ce2-8217-257575d0f61b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/75aa027d6b8c3e9e7f42218535a5ad06/2026-06/1fd22b25-fdd6-4fef-87ea-d9005057b82a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/362d5109e44c1924828c8c8e4a869575/2026-06/7cafd0f1-8c78-4b78-a424-9b0604c53e45.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ffa009a9932cd40407de35289860a358/2026-06/19f9994d-63c2-4ef8-8726-5c7cd9f1ed57.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/67834597b80acccd796b10c06721635c/2026-06/64d6b531-c23d-4970-8212-66565daf2803.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fd1968c5ef91dc205a6b23041ec26405/2026-06/71d8d79f-bbb1-4013-b00d-151fbd9fbc02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0d07b79a8b11ff40211c11f0346e920e/2026-06/71e8a0be-5656-4321-bdc3-7268184b1e66.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0f3b3c8ca548d130baf748d4cdd2e449/2026-06/227ed216-62fe-4f84-a49d-840b688ed923.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a9578cbe3d91ee20d5c7599ac553c77a/2026-06/423d3e12-cf9d-4d94-b90a-0c24aeac0bab.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a261ed0f94515f7747a681d5aeddb00a/2026-06/7083ec31-47ec-4460-9a98-ef5cee4fc365.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3952ec5fadc93be68f127d1466fbbd2c/2026-06/9173c34a-592b-4021-9e93-d5e52e84fa02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d91b804c52899ca0a58c686370079c5d/2026-06/78756e01-c26a-44b5-9fd1-d32b2f808